{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46881","headline":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 三 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金汤里面境何求，宝殿东边院最幽。\n栽种已添新竹影，画图兼列远山秋。\n形容岂合亲公子，章句争堪狎士流。\n虚负岷峨老僧约，年年雪水下汀洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}